{"availability":"available","full":"Kedreamix/Linly-Talker","name":"Linly-Talker","description":"Digital Avatar Conversational System - Linly-Talker. 😄✨ Linly-Talker is an intelligent AI system that combines large language models (LLMs) with visual models to create a novel human-AI interaction method. 🤝🤖 It integrates various technologies like Whisper, Linly, Microsoft Speech Services, and SadTalker talking head generation system. 🌟🔬","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":3465,"forks":543,"created":"2023-10-17T06:18:27Z","updated":"2026-02-10T05:17:05Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://kedreamix.github.io/","topics":[],"demo":"https://kedreamix.github.io/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:58.835Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:58.835Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:58.835Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T13:03:58.835Z","stars":3465,"forks":543}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Users can upload any images for the conversation","Linly-Talker is an innovative digital human conversation system that integrates the latest artificial intelligence technologies, including Large Language Models (LLM) 🤖, Automatic Speech Recognition (ASR) 🎙️, Text-to-Speech (TTS) 🗣️, and voice cloning technology 🎤. This system offers an interactive web interface through the Gradio platform 🌐, allowing users to upload images 📷 and engage in personalized dialogues with AI 💬.","The design philosophy of Linly-Talker is to create a new form of human-computer interaction that goes beyond simple Q&A. By integrating advanced technologies, it offers an intelligent digital human capable of understanding, responding to, and simulating human communication."],"features":["Exciting news! I've now incorporated both the powerful GeminiPro and Qwen large models into our conversational scene. Users can now upload images during the conversation, adding a whole new dimension to the interactions.","The deployment invocation method for FastAPI has been updated.","The advanced settings options for Microsoft TTS have been updated, increasing the variety of voice types. Additionally, video subtitles have been introduced to enhance visualization.","Updated the GPT multi-turn conversation system to establish contextual connections in dialogue, enhancing the interactivity and realism of the digital persona.","Updated Gradio to the latest version 4.16.0, providing the interface with additional functionalities such as capturing images from the camera to create digital personas, among others."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Kedreamix/Linly-Talker/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"2bc9a1bae7287b36f9cf0f5f7f286e2f202321b8226944654b267c3ccb77176e","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:58.879Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:58.879Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Users can upload any images for the conversation","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Kedreamix/Linly-Talker/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"optional","text":"If you want to request an API key for Gemini-Pro, you can visit this link:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Kedreamix/Linly-Talker/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"2bc9a1bae7287b36f9cf0f5f7f286e2f202321b8226944654b267c3ccb77176e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Kedreamix/Linly-Talker/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:58.880Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-02-10T05:17:05Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Kedreamix/Linly-Talker/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:58.883Z","hash":"2bc9a1bae7287b36f9cf0f5f7f286e2f202321b8226944654b267c3ccb77176e","originalBytes":55437,"storedBytes":55437,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["install","voice","models","linly-talker","model","pip","digital","speech","download","tts","bash","using","cloning","cosyvoice","python","human","update","asr","dialogue","p